        "## You've built a DES model!\n",
        "\n",
        "![](gif/beautiful.gif){height=400px}\n",
        "\n",
        "Now it's time to share results of the model.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Let's share the model\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "![](gif/go-wrong.gif)\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "You could send everyone your Python code.<br/>\n",
        "But they might not...\n",
        "\n",
        "* Know Python.\n",
        "* Have it installed.\n",
        "* Have the right environment or packages.\n",
        "* Know which bits to run or which numbers to change.\n",
        "* Have time to figure all that out.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Actually, let's send a report\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "Run a few scenarios.\n",
        "\n",
        "Make some lovely charts.\n",
        "\n",
        "Send everyone a report.\n",
        "\n",
        "Job done. Surely.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
