        "\n",
        "\"Can you rerun it with another three beds?\"\n",
        "\n",
        "\"What if we have fewer staff on Tuesdays?\"\n",
        "\n",
        "\"Can we change the arrival rate?\"\n",
        "\n",
        "\"Can you try all three of those things together?\"\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "Somewhere, a file called `final_report_v7_ACTUAL_FINAL.pdf` is being created.\n",
        "\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "But what if they could try it themselves?\n",
