        "\n",
        "## Enter Streamlit\n",
        "\n",
        "Streamlit lets us build a data-focused web application in Python.\n",
        "\n",
        "We can give our DES model an interface so people can:\n",
        "\n",
        "* Choose model inputs\n",
        "* Run scenarios\n",
        "* Explore charts and results\n",
        "\n",
        "![](images/streamlit_logo.png)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
